  "segments": [
    {
      "line": 1,
      "text": "1.前往哥拉尔镇海豚酒吧（136.158）与裘拜安（48.55）对话，选“否”。",
      "type": "dialogue-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        1
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 2,
      "text": "◇建议任务开始前将大部分魔币存入银行，仅预留学习技能的费用和可能产生的转职费用及被窃盗的费用（技能费用5000G、转职费用5000G）",
      "type": "currency-warning",
      "sourceLines": [
        2
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "text": "2.出哥拉尔镇东门，前往库鲁克斯岛（406.407）处与奇奇对话，选“否”进入战斗。",
      "type": "battle-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        3
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 4,
      "text": "◆战斗信息：",
      "type": "battle-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        4
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "text": "Lv.40奇奇，血量约3600，邪魔系，属性：水60火40，抗咒；技能：攻击（我方血少者）、圣盾、毒性攻击、连击、乾坤一掷、崩击",
      "type": "battle-enemy",
      "sourceLines": [
        5
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "text": "Lv.35 欧克山贼（蓝色）*2，血量约1400，人形系，属性：风60地40，不抗咒 ；技能：攻击 、装备破坏、攻击（我方血多者）",
      "type": "battle-enemy",
      "sourceLines": [
        6
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "text": "Lv.35 欧克山贼（黄色）*2，血量约1500 ，人形系，属性：风60地40，不抗咒；技能：攻击、防御、抢钱、攻击（我方血少者）",
      "type": "battle-enemy",
      "sourceLines": [
        7
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "text": "3.战斗胜利后进入头目假住处的入口，通过（11.6）处黄色传送石进入头目的～(略)。",
      "type": "maze-entry",
      "sourceLines": [
        8
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "text": "◆头目的～(略) 为随机迷宫，共5层",
      "type": "maze-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        9
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "text": "迷宫刷新时间：4小时（仅供参考），地图大小范围：50*50",
      "type": "maze-metadata",
      "sourceLines": [
        10
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "text": "宝箱数量：3",
      "type": "treasure-count",
      "sourceLines": [
        11
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "text": "魔物为Lv23~29欧克山贼（黄色与蓝色），最高遇敌数量7",
      "type": "encounter-area",
      "sourceLines": [
        12
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "text": "◆蓝色欧克山贼会破坏装备，建议脱去装备通过迷宫",
      "type": "equipment-warning",
      "sourceLines": [
        13
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 14,
      "text": "4.通过随机迷宫抵达“头目的房间前”，击倒“头目的房间前”内的魔物可获得【头目的钥匙】。",
      "type": "drop-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        14
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 15,
      "text": "◆“头目的房间前”为固定地图，魔物：Lv.27~29，欧克山贼（蓝色）、欧克山贼（黄色）",
      "type": "encounter-area",
      "sourceLines": [
        15
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 16,
      "text": "◆【头目的钥匙】较难掉落，建议先清理会装备破坏技能的欧克山贼（蓝色），不可交易、丢地消失、无法宠邮",
      "type": "item-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        16
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 17,
      "text": "◆欧克山贼（黄色）会掉落【头目的钥匙】",
      "type": "drop-source",
      "sourceLines": [
        17
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 18,
      "text": "5.队伍中持有【头目的钥匙】的玩家调查门，交出【头目的钥匙】后全队进入头目的房间。",
      "type": "party-door",
      "sourceLines": [
        18
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 19,
      "text": "6.与娜蕾希亚（13.8）对话，选“是”获得【头目帽子的制法】；选“否”、“是”传送至就职的房间。",
      "type": "branch-dialogue",
      "sourceLines": [
        19
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 20,
      "text": "◆怀旧服此步无法获得【头目帽子的制法】；学习方法参考：《娜蕾希亚的“邀请”》任务",
      "type": "server-rule",
      "sourceLines": [
        20
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 21,
      "text": "◆【头目帽子的制法】：不可交易，丢地消失，需由帽子工本人获得；双击【头目帽子的制法】，资深阶段以上的帽子工可习得【头目帽子】的制作方法",
      "type": "recipe-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        21
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 22,
      "text": "◆【头目帽子】数值见《帽子资料》文章",
      "type": "article-reference",
      "sourceLines": [
        22
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 23,
      "text": "7.与娜蕾希亚（13.8）对话即可就职盗贼。与欧鲁桑（16.10）对话，可交出5000G习得技能窃盗（巧取）。",
      "type": "career-and-skill",
      "sourceLines": [
        23
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 24,
      "text": "8.与尼摩其（16.13）对话，获得【染墨布】，可反复领取。再与之对话传送至库鲁克斯岛。",
      "type": "repeatable-item",
      "sourceLines": [
        24
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 25,
      "text": "◆【染墨布】：Lv.1头带、耐久300；装备后可提高窃盗技能成功率；不可交易、丢地消失、不可宠邮",
      "type": "item-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        25
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 26,
      "text": "9.返回哥拉尔镇海豚酒吧与裘拜安对话，任务完结。",
      "type": "completion-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        26
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 27,
      "text": "◆任务完结后若需要要晋阶，可前往库鲁克斯岛（406.407）处与奇奇对话，传送至头目的房间",
      "type": "post-completion-access",
      "sourceLines": [
        27
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 28,
      "text": "◆就职盗贼后若未与裘拜安对话，之后要提升阶级，与奇奇对话无法传送至头目的房间",
      "type": "completion-gate",
      "sourceLines": [
        28
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 29,
      "text": "◆怀旧服盗贼改名为游侠，技能窃盗改名为巧取；各阶称号亦进行调整，具体见职业版块《盗贼（游侠）》内容",
      "type": "server-renaming",
      "sourceLines": [
        29
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    }
  ],
